\newlabel{fig:tail}{{4}{5}{Focused tail-latency view. DART's flat p99 (green dashed) is the target; DEX offload-on (reds, one curve per \texttt {memThreadCount}) falls toward it as cache grows. For scans the dotted line extrapolates the DEX-on fit to the cache where it would meet DART ($\sim $2068\,MB uniform, $\sim $1284\,MB Zipfian)}{figure.caption.24}{}}
