\newlabel{fig:mpototal}{{5}{5}{Total misses per operation vs.\ cache (fixed denominator; 2 cores; shared 0--25 scale). Offloading (blue) is $\le $ no-offloading (grey) in every panel; both fall with cache and skew}{figure.caption.28}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces Misses per operation split into inner (blue) vs.\ leaf (amber); each bar-pair is off\,$|$\,on per cache. Offloaded lookups drive the leaf band to $\approx 0$ (the leaf is served inside the RPC); scans retain an entry-leaf component.}}{5}{figure.caption.29}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:mpostack}{{6}{5}{Misses per operation split into inner (blue) vs.\ leaf (amber); each bar-pair is off\,$|$\,on per cache. Offloaded lookups drive the leaf band to $\approx 0$ (the leaf is served inside the RPC); scans retain an entry-leaf component}{figure.caption.29}{}}
