\newlabel{fig:rtsplit}{{8}{7}{Composition of remote traffic per op: direct RDMA reads (blue) vs.\ RPC pushdowns (amber), off\,$|$\,on per cache (2 cores). Offloading converts reads into a much smaller number of RPCs}{figure.caption.31}{}}
